WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Step 1: In your Dodo dashboard switch to Test mode, then open Developer, API Keys and click Add API Key.

2
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Step 2: Keep Enable write access ticked: the agent creates your product, prices and checkout.

3
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Step 3: Copy the key straight away. Dodo shows it once.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Step 4: A test key works only in test mode, where nothing is charged. Each mode has its own keys and products.

5
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Step 5: In your centre, paste it into Test API key.

6
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Step 6: Click Connect Dodo Payments. The agent checks the key by reading your products.
